WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.760
If you ask the majority of people of color,

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:06.000
as well as the majority of police officers,

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:07.680
they would describe their relationship

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:09.920
as in the worst case, one of war.

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:13.300
I don't believe that within the policing community,

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.480
we have handled the conversation of bias and racism,

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.680
prejudice very well.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:23.240
The reality is these challenges are only going to increase.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:25.139
We need to do something different.

00:00:25.139 --> 00:00:27.680
Chief Bob, who I bet still wears a white dude's

00:00:27.680 --> 00:00:29.660
for Harris hat on the weekends,

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.580
hasn't been able to stop Trantifa

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.080
assaulting immigration officers for the last 100 days.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:36.860
And now we know why.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.060
Bob and his men are helping Antifa stay out of trouble.

